<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<contentList>
  <content contentuid="he061ff22ge04bg414ag8811ged0bff92111f" version="1">星界之靴</content>
  <content contentuid="hb3b7062eg4812g4167g8ed5g026387137579" version="1">轻如月华，这双吉斯洋基人的行军靴仍记得星界的银灰寂静。皮革被击中时会微微蜷缩，仿佛期待着人们一步跨出半个世界。</content>
  <content contentuid="h1011b3e6g5715g4692gb0c7g5884a38a4828" version="1">赋予&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="LONG_JUMP"&gt;跳跃&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
  <content contentuid="h3ef3836fg639fg4728g967cgeb24bc10712e" version="1">班恩的暴君法衣</content>
  <content contentuid="h187c7fcagbd1eg4504gba86gcd742b47b4c1" version="1">蛛丝、金线，与恐惧的幽暗芬芳。这袭长袍本是为一位将成为暴君之神的男人所缝制，而这块布料，至今仍向任何胆敢戴上他冠冕的人倾斜。</content>
  <content contentuid="h83976495g9643g4348g8ce7g9c6fce8c95a8" version="1">你被&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AURA_OF_TERROR"&gt;恐惧灵光&lt;/LSTag&gt;所笼罩。</content>
  <content contentuid="h74ecc071g7740g4355g85ffg169cd790f693" version="1">吟游诗人的遗产</content>
  <content contentuid="h2a854c49g24cbg4f6eg80aeg4b778882d7e2" version="1">“你们这帮可怜虫根本搞不明白，这点戏法对我来说有多轻松，”学院舞会上最吵闹的那位术士如是说——就在他消失进自己创造的袖珍维度的前一晚。</content>
  <content contentuid="h1638728cg2a02g4192gb1ceg0beae37c6933" version="1">觅血手套</content>
  <content contentuid="h68475357g28afg4de2ga9b5g8b0db7254a69" version="1">指尖钉满了陨铁的碎片，缭绕着一圈微弱的紫焰。这双手套，为那些能从利刃穿刺时的阻滞中，掂量出一颗心脏之重的猎人们所造。</content>
  <content contentuid="hf46866b0g41ebg429fg8bf5g50ad5a3c2900" version="1">光速之靴</content>
  <content contentuid="h0c4a8cf6ge51ag4570gabafg6318140ef3c0" version="1">饰以羽织，底柔无骨，曾用于包抄敌军与远远甩开友军。鞋匠赌咒说这皮革是以风元素的吐息鞣制的，但他也赌咒说自己是个王子。</content>
  <content contentuid="h985b087ag44adg49aeg9868g8de546dc0d6e" version="1">至高防护斗篷</content>
  <content contentuid="h27a9746dg6fd0g4af9g9f99gc4910e8a6ebc" version="1">缝制于八叶工坊之中。法师奥提路克极偏爱这种织法，声称它能偏折任何瞄准肩部以下的法术，他坚称，也包括裁缝递来的账单。</content>
  <content contentuid="h0473c299gb594g4038g961agae0cff63bd42" version="1">织法大师斗篷</content>
  <content contentuid="h34ad41bdg4578g41a6g9423g71afa9eedee7" version="1">法师谭森在密斯特拉本尊确认了他在八叶中的席位那天，所披的正是这领斗篷。每一根丝线都记得他曾施展过的每一道法术，每当强大的魔法近在咫尺，便会隐隐泛起微光。</content>
  <content contentuid="h0cb4d312g2684g4ec8g8dedgb7478b40dff7" version="1">你被&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="FIRE_SHIELD_CHILL"&gt;火焰护盾：寒冷&lt;/LSTag&gt;所笼罩。</content>
  <content contentuid="h8ac3890cg1303g44e8gb668gff3f8766aa85" version="1">巴尔神选之冠</content>
  <content contentuid="h1e3f09b6gf458g46aegadd7g0e91f6537ecd" version="1">这顶头盔的双角，曾亲眼见证了巴尔之子间最初的谋杀。老沙洛佛克作为凡人最后瞥见的，是同胞的手足递出的匕首。而在巴尔的教派看来，至今仍无一桩行径比那场安静的家事更为神圣。</content>
  <content contentuid="h144f0d86ge0c3g4a05g808fg0552e38b1e98" version="1">令你体内充盈着&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ALCH_ELIXIR_BLOODLUST"&gt;嗜血灵药&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
  <content contentuid="h51578d16g9be3g464bgb31dgacc4d54ab4c5" version="1">炽焰堡垒</content>
  <content contentuid="hf8fa03afg4c2cg4559g8e17g2ee8e3eda1d9" version="1">以一位圣武士葬礼的柴堆余烬锻造，这副板甲在铆钉中仍封存着一粒缓慢燃烧的余烬。望之冰冷，身穿却倍感温暖，它对任何胆敢攻击自己的事物都绝无宽宥。</content>
  <content contentuid="hd0e93931gbdd7g4884g9d8fg692a15c7b2f7" version="1">你被&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="FIRE_SHIELD_WARM"&gt;火焰护盾：温暖&lt;/LSTag&gt;所笼罩。</content>
  <content contentuid="h2f3eefe5g4199g47a4g9b15g1a658a5edc76" version="1">精铁手套</content>
  <content contentuid="h2fd1e392g5fffg408egba50g56fa93f61e36" version="1">平实的板甲手套，近乎朴素。不见辉光，亦无铭文，唯有每一位曾穿戴它们并赢下胜利的士兵，所留下的那份冷静笃定。</content>
  <content contentuid="h857c6487gd184g44d3g8f9ag4b98fb361f09" version="1">狡黠巫师帽</content>
  <content contentuid="haab25014g1c79g40cag80efg7074f9be8cc6" version="1">其形乐观，其意叵测。帽檐向前斜探，仿佛正侧耳窃听。而在这寂静的夜里，曾有人听见那毛毡喃喃自语，回答着那些无人问询的问题。</content>
  <content contentuid="h29a003d5g2c39g45ccgb1a6g12056d117bba" version="1">赋予&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="FOXS_CUNNING"&gt;狐之狡黠&lt;/LSTag&gt;与&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="DETECT_THOUGHTS"&gt;侦测思想&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
  <content contentuid="h0d9e3031g039ag4233gad08ge04d80a23faa" version="1">织法大师兜帽</content>
  <content contentuid="h22c3c145gdc0ag436aga4adg41ea697a85b2" version="1">谭森在受任圣职那天戴的正是这顶兜帽。仪式一结束，奥提路克和毕格比便对他搞了个著名的恶作剧。那恶作剧究竟是什么，始终无人知晓，但那两个捣蛋鬼此后整整一个月，打喷嚏时都会喷出漫天星图。</content>
  <content contentuid="h83d10e92g7878g46c7g892agbe5cc0d49dd5" version="1">令你处于&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLUR"&gt;朦胧术&lt;/LSTag&gt;状态。</content>
  <content contentuid="h2099ac57gd798g4b35ga644g907b5e7980d1" version="1">宗师遗产</content>
  <content contentuid="h2d4ac6aegd3b1g4468ga6cbgea37574a45cf" version="1">曾属色雷斯坎王室之物。这双铁手套仍记得那位王子的握持，并将他传奇武艺的一缕余晖，借予任何能戴上它的手。</content>
  <content contentuid="h13e229c0g63b7g4294gb8c0gd06ca335bad8" version="1">威仪板甲</content>
  <content contentuid="h3ec37184g92c6g4e7cg863ag82fafeb87afb" version="1">一件军官配发的战袍，覆盖着这副保存得完好无损的甲胄。显然，这身板甲踏过的阅兵场远多于战场，然而它那凛然的分量，却不曾因此减损分毫。</content>
  <content contentuid="ha4304c68g403ag40bfgbea5g4be8db311eed" version="1">赋予&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="PROTECTION_FROM_EVIL_AND_GOOD"&gt;防护善恶&lt;/LSTag&gt;与&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="RIGHTEOUS_CLARITY"&gt;正义明晰&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
  <content contentuid="h32d1c3aeg1f7fg4b67g9fbcg81be0f9c9df0" version="1">孔雀石兜帽</content>
  <content contentuid="hf1d55f8agd794g42bbg9109g1b779584a753" version="1">以碾碎的孔雀石染就的德鲁伊丝绸。静止时布面素净无纹，冥想之际，兜帽上却会浮现藤叶交织的细纹，待到风暴来袭，那些叶片便会纷纷飘动。</content>
  <content contentuid="ha4de2cefga144g4c3fgb4aag440ea915302b" version="1">圣卫勋章</content>
  <content contentuid="h0d396bdfg1ee4g460agb636g809fe9046d2d" version="1">提尔的圣物匣，为三神教团的至高审判官所铸。金属触手微凉，当立于盟友身旁时，便会静静散发出一道守护的光芒。</content>
  <content contentuid="he45837aega2cdg4dc7ga751g590eefaf7c56" version="1">你被&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AURA_OF_PROTECTION"&gt;守护灵光&lt;/LSTag&gt;所笼罩。</content>
  <content contentuid="h7a03f96eg650dg4d5cgbb5cgad0097b63741" version="1">破誓者板甲</content>
  <content contentuid="h2b10ea9eg1feeg46f1g970ag48be022c764a" version="1">那些背弃了自身誓言、并将这份失落化为甲胄的圣武士们所披的战甲。这身金属，炎夏中触手冰凉，严冬时却又暖得反常。</content>
  <content contentuid="h647cad96g8be5g4203ga72fg03fa712562e0" version="1">你被&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AURA_OF_HATE"&gt;憎恨灵光&lt;/LSTag&gt;所笼罩。</content>
  <content contentuid="h3d4eb06dg950dg4508g8bceg597b5478b062" version="1">虔诚板甲</content>
  <content contentuid="h3d3c59f9g623cg4a48gaed0gcca2ab0de103" version="1">以虔诚之塔的白银锻造，那里正是最初的圣武士之誓被立下的地方。形貌朴素，决意深沉。它的分量，便是一份恪守誓言的分量。</content>
  <content contentuid="hdafcbfa7g8150g4550gb9c3g587ee38b92aa" version="1">你被&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AURA_OF_DEVOTION"&gt;虔诚灵光&lt;/LSTag&gt;所笼罩，并获得&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="DIVINE_FAVOR"&gt;神恩&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
  <content contentuid="h88d68802ge1bcg4088gb296g120025f1893d" version="1">和蔼可亲之戒</content>
  <content contentuid="h6270ce47g58f4g499cg8b99g8e26cc7b0f70" version="1">一缕寄于金属中的小小善意。佩戴它的那只手，打出的手势会更为从容；而倾听者们，总会在不知不觉间，比原先打算的稍微靠近一些。</content>
  <content contentuid="h0ea35400gafeag4b38g9bd0gd7fe110901f2" version="1">至高防护之戒</content>
  <content contentuid="h78515d3dgfdeeg455bga3c6gd2ab330d4dc5" version="1">细小的盾牌、小圆盾、手盾与臂铠，浅浅地压在戒环之上。一整个军械库的谱系，尽数佩戴于一指之间。</content>
  <content contentuid="hf02edda5g897dg4f4dgbaf1ge106c9f3abfa" version="1">织法大师长袍</content>
  <content contentuid="h7ddb7cf5g1e33g4277g9ce5g0af78438870c" version="1">曾由伊迪丝·克拉克尔所穿着。她六岁那年，便央求伟大的奥提路克收她为徒。他笑了，密斯特拉却没有，反而赐予了这女孩这袭长袍。伊迪丝比奥提路克多活了整整六十年。</content>
  <content contentuid="h44c981a1g0cbbg4634gb263g3e343f96d97b" version="1">赋予&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="MAGE_ARMOR"&gt;魔法护甲&lt;/LSTag&gt;与&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLADE_WARD"&gt;剑刃防护&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
  <content contentuid="h71104e50ga2cag4649g82feg8ae2688fdf71" version="1">沙洛佛克的神选甲胄</content>
  <content contentuid="h572b4822geeeag43ebg81b5gb7ec6f54b20a" version="1">为第一个妄图封神的巴尔之子所锤铸。这副板甲至今仍在滴淌着那股野心，而几乎所有史官都一致认为，沙洛佛克那张脸生来便适合扣在头盔底下：下巴太翘，獠牙太多。</content>
  <content contentuid="h5911a4dag495bg46b4g9b6eg2b3a6b8299c6" version="1">将你铭刻以&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="END_ALLYABILITIES_BHAALBUFF"&gt;血承之最&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
  <content contentuid="h41bde74bg5b82g46e0g910dg80b859acfdf1" version="1">疾跑鞋</content>
  <content contentuid="h2551073ag7d08g4cb5g9c7ag2241ec09de69" version="1">柔韧的鞋底轻托着脚踝，精制的青铜弹簧缝嵌在鞋跟深处。曾是银月城逐晓者之物，她们在每个夏日的黎明，沿着城墙与旭日竞速。</content>
  <content contentuid="hd86b9c53gd668g45d6g9b0dgf9f4b84f0f85" version="1">自然睿智</content>
  <content contentuid="hc90e49b3ga5ccg409ega3a7g24d14a43017b" version="1">一顶以羽毛与橡叶编织的头环，靠着主人的吐息，它才始终保持着这一抹鲜润的绿。枭之圆环的德鲁伊们宣称，任何一头能在耳边听见动静的野兽都会对它开口说话，不过大多数野兽，其实并没有什么想说的。</content>
  <content contentuid="h1e4db3e6g7388g4814gb132g87d874f6064e" version="1">赋予&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="OWLS_WISDOM"&gt;枭之睿智&lt;/LSTag&gt;与&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="PETPAL"&gt;动物交谈&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
  <content contentuid="he9753235gde0ag4f7bgbb7bgfed246d8d432" version="1">卓越重击</content>
  <content contentuid="ha16be8aeg6d54g4709g9cffge2f1d449408f" version="1">攻击时达成&lt;LSTag Tooltip="CriticalHit"&gt;重击&lt;/LSTag&gt;所需的掷骰值降低&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;点。此效果可&lt;b&gt;叠加&lt;/b&gt;。</content>
  <content contentuid="h94ffcc15g1661g4510g8ebbg7627d838b465" version="1">孔雀石低语</content>
  <content contentuid="h038110a3gd818g48d4gba4ag7f0cd6ef906a" version="1">&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Wisdom"&gt;感知&lt;/LSTag&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免检定&lt;/LSTag&gt;增加&lt;b&gt;+[1]&lt;/b&gt;。你的&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SpellDifficultyClass"&gt;法术豁免等级&lt;/LSTag&gt;提高&lt;b&gt;+[2]&lt;/b&gt;。</content>
  <content contentuid="haa336baeg31f3g45aag9e26gacaf3aaab90d" version="1">誓冠之忠</content>
  <content contentuid="hbdd882b5g7f3fg45f4gb9eeg551f6ba126fa" version="1">你对&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;与&lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt;具有&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Resistant"&gt;抗性&lt;/LSTag&gt;。&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免检定&lt;/LSTag&gt;增加&lt;b&gt;+[3]&lt;/b&gt;。</content>
  <content contentuid="h0cbe2ac2g1980g4bf9g8795g21a8992c357b" version="1">沙洛佛克的混沌之剑</content>
  <content contentuid="h2ac9ea4dge5fcg4393gac66gba603e0186e4" version="1">沙洛佛克在攀向神位途中所高举的利刃。以谋杀缚于巴尔，它从每一道切开的伤口中痛饮深吮，并随着每一个被遗忘的名字，变得愈发冰冷。</content>
  <content contentuid="h7653de21gc306g4cd8gaa37ga04a122b5e11" version="1">使用此武器对一名生物造成伤害时，恢复&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;点生命值。</content>
  <content contentuid="h7216de07g0e0bg4fddgb23bg9f4c3e71cefb" version="1">星界步伐</content>
  <content contentuid="h0a777c9agb27eg4c01g86b4g165053289e9e" version="1">暴君灵光</content>
  <content contentuid="h7eae7a25g35b5g47b2gbf18g3e8f2dd450e9" version="1">余烬防护</content>
  <content contentuid="h46aef5c4g7768g4774gb832g63e54939c30a" version="1">霜缚斗篷</content>
  <content contentuid="h0a631f43g31c2g4552g925cg2cc202855911" version="1">狡黠洞察</content>
  <content contentuid="h14025b62g2803g4a92ga3b6gcf1945b9e310" version="1">编织朦胧</content>
  <content contentuid="h31086832g815fg498cgbc7bgff48504ed823" version="1">元帅圣盾</content>
  <content contentuid="hed7e09c2gae96g45e3g83c6g19428d610a83" version="1">光环持有者</content>
  <content contentuid="h5dca90d6gd05eg45c1g8690g10691f13a385" version="1">憎恨灵光</content>
  <content contentuid="h8886639aga357g4343gb0d8g2129ded0e02a" version="1">初誓</content>
  <content contentuid="h50b66b95gfa58g4f25g9814g3a30be0e39bd" version="1">编织防护</content>
  <content contentuid="h60984863g3781g487aga7c9ga64c26ae259c" version="1">巴尔之印</content>
  <content contentuid="hbba691a2g5b62g4a6eg85cfg96b4144916c6" version="1">杀戮嗜血</content>
  <content contentuid="h8fc7636dgd836g4963g8fbbg22ffcc1c8e62" version="1">荒野之言</content>
  <content contentuid="h45bc72b6gcd3bg4f8eg924dgc4f37c0df813" version="1">巴尔之锋</content>
  <content contentuid="h02ecd566g559fg46e7g8dacg40660387ad0a" version="1">你的&lt;LSTag Tooltip="CriticalHit"&gt;重击&lt;/LSTag&gt;触发阈值降低&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;。</content>
  <content contentuid="h84765791g2a2dg4a81g9db0gbb3daf34f1be" version="1">精准打击</content>
  <content contentuid="ha44e3e41gdef2g48edg8e87gccb9dc054e34" version="1">你的&lt;LSTag Tooltip="MeleeWeaponAttack"&gt;近战武器&lt;/LSTag&gt;攻击获得&lt;b&gt;+[1]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll"&gt;攻击掷骰&lt;/LSTag&gt;加值。若&lt;LSTag Tooltip="MeleeWeaponAttack"&gt;近战武器&lt;/LSTag&gt;攻击掷骰结果不高于&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;，则&lt;b&gt;重掷&lt;/b&gt;该骰子一次，并取&lt;b&gt;较高&lt;/b&gt;结果。</content>
  <content contentuid="h6aa44c6cg161fg4db3ga145g7d2ba248406c" version="1">钢铁大师</content>
  <content contentuid="h168e33c3g4480g4999ga932g009c25d974e3" version="1">你&lt;b&gt;无视&lt;/b&gt;对&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;和&lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt;的&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Resistant"&gt;抗性&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
  <content contentuid="ha13012a4g956ag4787g86d1g5212f3b96484" version="1">奥术斗篷</content>
